ticket: 002
title: Which delivery channel ships first
type: grilling
status: closed
blocked_by: [001]
claimed_by: junhanliu.dev@gmail.com
claimed_at: 2026-08-07T00:01:00Z
---

## Question

In-app only, email only, or both — and if both, which is the source of truth?

## Resolution

In-app ships first and is the only v1 channel. Email arrives later as a daily
digest only — per-event email is ruled out permanently, not merely deferred.

Rationale: users already complain about email volume from the old system, and
that complaint is the founding motivation for this epic. Any per-event email
would reproduce the problem the system exists to solve. In-app is therefore
the source of truth; the future digest is a summary view over it, never a
parallel delivery path.

Rules/wiki cross-check: `espalier/rules/` and `espalier/wiki/` are empty —
Step 1.5 skipped per contract; no citations.
```

